I have updated the beta umoria 4.87 sources on ucbarpa.Berkeley.EDU.
You can either ftp the moria487.tar.Z.a* files, or, if you already have
umoria 4.87 sources, you can just ftp the patch file u487.p2 which is
about 33k.

There is one bug fix, for the shell '!' command.
There are many fixes to solve portability problems encountered by:
  Gnu C Compiler, SYS III cc, HP-UX cc
Also, there are some documentation changes.

I have been told that moria 4.85 and 4.87 do not work properly on HP-UX
systems.  If anyone has gotten moria to work under this OS, I would
appreciate a note explaining what the problem is, if any.

